  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SHC framework agr. 2001</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SHK ramavtal 2001</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Svenska Helsingforskommitt&#xe9;n har ett sextiotal projekt med Sidafinansiering i alla delar av det forna Jugoslavien. Tyngdpunkten ligger i Serbien med n&#xe4;stan 40% av projektsumman. Man satsar framf&#xf6;r allt p&#xe5; mediarelaterade projekt men &#xe4;ven p&#xe5; rena demokratiprojekt och ett litet kulturprogram.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Swedish Helsinki Committee has appr. 60 Sida-financed projects throughout the Western Balkans with a concentration to Serbia with almost 40% of the project sum. SHC concentrates on media-related projects but also supports pure democracy projects as well as a small culture programme.</narrative>
  </description>
